The Apartment is a [[:Category:Housing|housing]] [[Lots|lot]] that was formerly awarded to every new player.<ref>[https://archive.org/details/freerealmsoffi00trac Free Realms: The Official Handbook and Strategy Guide] on [https://www.archive.org Internet Archive]</ref> On January 26, 2012, the [[Wilds Condo]] replaced the Apartment as the starting home for new players. Players who already had an Apartment before this date kept their Apartment and received a new Wilds Condo.

==Description==
This plot contains only a small apartment with 1 room. Default, the walls are a dark blue and the floor is made out of wood. It contains a fireplace and 5 windows. It is possible to go out of bounds by passing through the roof. <ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlK_LQJmuUQ free realms how to get out of your house (laketree lot, condo, and apartment)] on [https://www.youtube.com YouTube]</ref>

==Dimensions==
The dimensions<ref>[https://guidescroll.com/2011/10/free-realms-detailed-housing-guide/ Free Realms Detailed Housing Guide] on [https://guidescroll.com/ GuideScroll]</ref> of the apartment are:
*Height: 4 Blocks
*Width 9.5 Blocks
*Length 10.5 Blocks
*Volume 399 Blocks

